type project
version 1
---
# The fonts og-ui's cooked-font text frames draw with (text-bidi,
# text-kerning, text-edit, text-mixed-runs): the import settings only. The
# font files are templates/ui-kit/assets/fonts' (not copied here); the
# native test (tests/text_gfx.rs) and the browser harness
# (packages/engine/tests/web/reference-gfx.ts) each copy this project and
# those fonts into a scratch directory and cook it, so both tiers draw from
# the same cook.
name "og-ui text fonts"
id "og-ui-text-fonts"
entry "src/main.ts"
